  "description": "Full-color, short-run custom printed folding cartons.",
  "notesHtml": "<p><strong>Custom folding cartons</strong>: We make fully custom folding cartons. Minimum order is 50 boxes, with no die charge and free setup. You can order any in-between size not listed in the size table. It is priced as the next larger size that fits it.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Need a larger size or quantity not listed?</strong> For larger sizes, larger quantities or thicker stock, contact the factory for a quote. We can produce folding cartons up to 40pt thick and in larger sizes than listed here. Finishes such as embossing, debossing, aqueous coating, UV coating and foil stamping can also be added.</p>",
